  "source_pdf": "downloads/nezhas-shape-town-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "e4c78af37663984fec6299cdb51feec5cec4f6c7c0a6aaeb60b4a5f63d591f8c",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "71362685400187ad0b3816520fa7524402e294ab3692c18c43c935a21bca0a29",
      "text": "哪吒的形状小镇",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f8e51e4958a655ab6bdf214056462d1d02df8201166b41bc82d7912c028c51a2",
      "text": "哪吒在地板上\n拼一座纸做的小镇：\n红房子、绿树，\n还有一条长长的黄马路。\n“我的小镇还需要窗户！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eefd69d8558b704c27471263cafa00d8f0e39e3fd97d10f054d44aee3f3991ea",
      "text": "每座房子都贴上了方窗户，\n可蓝房子还没有。\n哪吒在纸盒里找呀找。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a192d4cd5039a961ec4ce068065678fb601697594825546367a55488d9fd1c8e",
      "text": "方块用完了！\n盒子里只剩两块蓝色三角形，\n形状一样，大小也一样。\n哪吒叹了口气：\n“两个三角形又不是方块。”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9b8433621a533b947dfe98bd3686471df99355f974e99e1165389e44fe4c55c8",
      "text": "悟空把两块三角形顶在头上，\n尖角朝上：\n“看！我的三角帽\n有两个尖尖角！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "601e653be402f73e871fa4200bd9e85e564eedbcd10fd54dd30b34aebf727e95",
      "text": "玉兔笑了：\n“我们把它们转一转，\n试试看。”\n她把一块三角形转了个方向。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7c91686dc4cfaafcab20a4c47e99633bfb836c263a26b9330f96dd746f391e2d",
      "text": "“把三角形转一转，\n长长的那条边就对上了。”\n玉兔把它们推到一起。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a03fda18a3254eb4222f775bda6921416c47d075ad82f13a206af61545c26cf",
      "text": "四个角，四条边，\n每条边都一样长。\n哪吒大喊：“是方块！”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d44ba52140c57e6f7e1059fb34c7c68fb143e16b84bd30ac135cc3d85cdc1b6c",
      "text": "哪吒把方块\n举到蓝房子的墙上比一比，\n大小正合适！\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8de41df33624cf9ce89df917b65e3bce92fd98229c1d79331d49cef8c18aad63",
      "text": "悟空说：“等等，让我试试！”\n他换个方向转一转，\n这回是短边贴在一起。\n“变成一个大三角形！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "69a76059b395b10d5b41c2675c6f15c8b77f7c2b5881fbd2ae55f5fee6cdbac8",
      "text": "哪吒把大三角形\n放到一座房子顶上：\n“像一个尖尖的屋顶！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef4d458f7e621fe9abf0b41e187ec8afba19d7befe4a963ed540d2dd38f58c7a",
      "text": "玉兔数一数角：\n方块有四个角，\n大三角形有三个角。\n“还是那两块，\n却拼出不一样的形状！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "99648702b3d0224877a8cd52ee387344a7ec771f2c526616182715a7bf3ef3d1",
      "text": "可是蓝房子\n还缺一扇窗户呢。\n他们把两块三角形转回来，\n又拼成一个方块。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "16c9cbccedb333c907e8996d39af38c45ae2925e3f8344f01eb2cc78bed01610",
      "text": "哪吒把方窗户\n贴到蓝房子上。\n每座房子都有窗户了，\n小镇完成啦！\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "24dfecf3602222778a2bc76b9193ec34779fd39e26f3e9d04a0ce86c16bd3ea3",
      "text": "小玩偶们\n走在黄马路上，\n探头看看新窗户。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3b3678f636404e8e90b1aeeff65646e277e09bdb4de06e47f5f7f583c5821823",
      "text": "悟空摸摸自己的头：\n“咦！我的三角帽\n变成窗户啦！”\n大家都哈哈大笑。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec4df2cb93b7c9510e763d90f22b8a350c71d1d514885ba4d4c68e844fdb41c9",
